                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.51/1700: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Caffery</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de
                                Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1940-01-25T15:00:00-03:00">January 25, 1940—3
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received January 25—2:11 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>39. Department’s 17, January 23, 2 p.m. I have had another talk with the Minister
                    of Finance. He has promised to try to get more money for the coffee realization
                    loan. He has singled out this loan because at least part of the milreis proceeds
                    of the coffee tax have already been deposited for it.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Caffery</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
